[gd_scene load_steps=18 format=3]

; M3-BPR-01: the Saltgrass Causeway route on the way out (Ch3 ch03_causeway_shore / ch03_causeway_harrier), low
; tide at 14:30, greybox until env-art's causeway-route kit lands (M2-ENV-10 / M3-ENV-06). Grade from
; docs/kb/art/environments/haluna.md `ch03_causeway`: sun 52 deg, key #FFEAD8 3.0, sky fill #A9DCF2 0.6, lut_ch02_noon
; (+200 K): exposure 0.65, saturation x1.12, the color script's Ch1/Ch2 day sky #2E7FD6 / #A9DCF2 and almost no fog
; (ch02_noon has none; a far haze only). A thin path of old stone slabs over tidal flats, widened to a flat
; slab landing at y = 0 for the fight, coral boulders, tidepools and saltgrass; the lagoon beyond at low water.

